# Quarto leaves a copy of a chapter figure directory beside the source when a
# single-file render is interrupted or run outside the project. The real copy
# lives under the output directory and is what ships; these are intermediates,
# and without this line a future "git add -A" commits them.
book/*_files/
site_libs/
